# Authored analytical fixture; no third-party coordinate dataset is copied.
# Ideal rocksalt NaCl, conventional cell, approximately room temperature.
# a = 5.64 Angstrom is rounded; not a measured precision lattice parameter.
# Reference crystal prototype: https://aflow.org/p/AB_cF8_225_a_b-001/
# Density reference: 4*(22.98976928+35.45) g/mol/(N_A*a^3)
# gives 2163.616424776758 kg/m^3, using exact SI N_A = 6.02214076e23/mol.
# Test tolerances: relative 1e-12 for volume and 1e-10 for density.
data_nacl_rocksalt
_cell_length_a 5.64
_cell_length_b 5.64
_cell_length_c 5.64
_cell_angle_alpha 90
_cell_angle_beta 90
_cell_angle_gamma 90
_space_group_IT_number 225
_space_group_name_H-M_alt 'F m -3 m'
loop_
_atom_site_label
_atom_site_type_symbol
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
_atom_site_occupancy
Na1 Na 0 0 0 1
Cl1 Cl 0.5 0.5 0.5 1
